# Build context hygiene: without this every docker build ships the virtualenv, the
# node_modules tree and the entire data directory to the daemon.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
frontend/dist
data/
backend/devdata/
.git/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.dev
